  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-glacier-retreat-monitoring:\n\n- Extracts multi-temporal glacier extents using NDSI and vectorizes glacier boundaries into polygons.\n- Analyzes terminus retreat and area change over time, outputting area curves and retreat rates.\n- Supports both synthetic data generation (offline mode) and user-provided multi-temporal image cubes.\n- Outputs include GeoJSON boundaries, GeoTIFF glacier mask, JSON with retreat analysis, and a run manifest.\n- Fully offline operation; no user data is uploaded.",
